  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Migration Data in Armenia: Advancing Progress in Achieving the Global Compact for Migration Objectives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Although Armenia has made notable progress in strengthening its migration data systems in recent years, significant challenges remain. These gaps hinder the development of evidence-based policies and the achievement of effective migration governance. In particular, there is a pressing need to improve migration data collection and management&#x2014;especially in the context of Armenia&#x2019;s EU accession process and efforts to monitor progress on implementing the Global Compact for Safe, Orderly and Regular Migration (GCM).  The objective of this project is to contribute to enhanced migration governance and monitoring of the GCM implementation in Armenia.</narrative>
  </description>
